    <p class="lede">Where I spend my days: running and securing a Microsoft 365 environment end to end — systems administration, security engineering, and data governance in one role. From identity and endpoints to threat response, infrastructure, migrations, and Swiss data-protection compliance.</p>
    <div class="skillset">
      <div class="skillgroup">
        <div class="cat">Identity &amp; access</div>
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip">Microsoft Entra ID</span>
          <span class="chip">Conditional Access</span>
          <span class="chip">FIDO2 / passkeys</span>
          <span class="chip">phishing-resistant MFA</span>
          <span class="chip">least privilege / RBAC</span>
          <span class="chip">OAuth app governance</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="skillgroup">
        <div class="cat">Endpoint &amp; device</div>
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip">Microsoft Intune</span>
          <span class="chip">Win32 app deployment</span>
          <span class="chip">Attack Surface Reduction</span>
          <span class="chip">compliance policies</span>
          <span class="chip">BitLocker / LAPS</span>
          <span class="chip">Windows · macOS · Linux</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="skillgroup">
        <div class="cat">Threat protection &amp; response</div>
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip">Defender for Business</span>
          <span class="chip">Defender for Office 365</span>
          <span class="chip">incident response</span>
          <span class="chip">honeypots / deception</span>
          <span class="chip">phishing simulation</span>
          <span class="chip">alerting pipelines</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="skillgroup">
        <div class="cat">Data governance &amp; compliance</div>
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip">Microsoft Purview DLP</span>
          <span class="chip">sensitivity labeling</span>
          <span class="chip">data classification</span>
          <span class="chip">data lifecycle &amp; retention</span>
          <span class="chip">Swiss nLPD / LPD</span>
          <span class="chip">cantonal LIPDA</span>
          <span class="chip">DPA review</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="skillgroup">
        <div class="cat">Systems &amp; infrastructure</div>
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip">Microsoft 365 administration</span>
          <span class="chip">PowerShell</span>
          <span class="chip">endpoint fleet management</span>
          <span class="chip">migrations</span>
          <span class="chip">self-hosting (Proxmox · Docker · Caddy)</span>
          <span class="chip">SharePoint / OneDrive</span>
          <span class="chip">DNS · networking</span>
          <span class="chip">backup &amp; recovery</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="skillgroup">
        <div class="cat">How I work</div>
        <div class="chips">
          <span class="chip">defense in depth</span>
          <span class="chip">least privilege</span>
          <span class="chip">report-only before enforce</span>
          <span class="chip">verify logs before blocking</span>
          <span class="chip">open-source by preference</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CAREER -->
<section class="section" id="career">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="tag ok">OK</span><span class="prompt"><span class="u">$</span> journalctl -u career --reverse</span></div>
    <h2>Career path</h2>
    <p class="lede">Reverse-chronological, like any good log.</p>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="when">2026 — now</div>
        <div class="role">IT &amp; Security Lead <span class="org">— Croix-Rouge Valais</span></div>
        <div class="desc">IT operations and security ownership. Blue Team: hardening, monitoring, incident response, identity &amp; endpoint security.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="when">2023 — 2025</div>
        <div class="role">Analyst Desk <span class="org">— CIGES SA</span></div>
        <div class="desc">L1 helpdesk, IT technician, L1 InfoSec — and teaching entry-level InfoSec classes.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="when">2016 — 2023</div>
        <div class="role">Certified System Engineer <span class="org">— SKIDATA GmbH</span></div>
        <div class="desc">Sysadmin and database management; configuration of access systems (turnstiles, cashdesks, RFID/barcode); networking; QA &amp; testing for new products; customer training; project management.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="when">2015 — 4-month project</div>
        <div class="role">Mediamatician <span class="org">— État du Valais, Land Registry</span></div>
        <div class="desc">RF2020: modernizing the land registry and introducing a computerized federal land-parcel information system.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="when">2015 — 2017</div>
        <div class="role">Podcaster &amp; Journalist <span class="org">— EuroTechTalk.com</span><span class="badge">side</span></div>
        <div class="desc">Produced a weekly one-hour live tech-news podcast (and VOD), in English.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="when">2011 — 2016</div>
        <div class="role">Music Journalist <span class="org">— Tink.ch</span><span class="badge">side</span></div>
        <div class="desc">Coverage of music festivals including Caprices Festival (Crans-Montana) and Tohu-Bohu (Veyras).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="when">2008</div>
        <div class="role">IT Intern <span class="org">— Banque Cantonale du Valais</span></div>
        <div class="desc">Three-month IT internship.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CREDENTIALS -->
<section class="section" id="credentials">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span class="tag ok">OK</span><span class="prompt"><span class="u">$</span> ls ~/credentials/</span></div>
    <h2>Credentials</h2>

    <div class="subhead">memberships &amp; community</div>
    <div class="grid cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="yr">2026</div>
        <div class="ttl">Microsoft Security Advisors Program</div>
        <div class="meta"><span>Microsoft</span><span class="s-on">member</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="yr">active</div>
        <div class="ttl">Cybersécurité Valais</div>
