      <div class="card proj">
        <div class="yr">blue team</div>
        <div class="ttl">m365-intune-scripts</div>
        <div class="meta"><span>Scripts for Microsoft 365 &amp; Intune — endpoint deployment, detection, and hardening.</span></div>
        <div class="repo"><a href="https://github.com/Bluewal/m365-intune-scripts" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/Bluewal/m365-intune-scripts</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card proj">
        <div class="yr">honeypot</div>
